<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Arun Babu - Resume</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --ink: #111827;
        --muted: #4b5563;
        --line: #d1d5db;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: "Times New Roman", Georgia, serif;
      }
      .page {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 28px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 28px 34px 32px;
      }
      header {
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 26px;
        letter-spacing: 0.6px;
      }
      .role {
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-top: 4px;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      }
      .contact {
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        color: var(--muted);
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .section {
        margin-top: 14px;
      }
      h2 {
        margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding-bottom: 4px;
      }
      p {
        margin: 6px 0;
        line-height: 1.4;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      }
      ul {
        margin: 6px 0 0 18px;
        padding: 0;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      }
      .muted {
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      .pill {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 12px;
        background: #f9fafb;
      }
      .entry {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 13.5px;
      }
      .entry strong {
        font-weight: 600;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <header>
        <h1>Arun Babu</h1>
        <div class="role">React Developer</div>
        <div class="contact">
          <span>arunbabu1047@gmail.com</span>
          <span>+91 8870064429</span>
          <span>linkedin.com/in/arunbabu1047</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Summary</h2>
        <p>
          React developer with 1 year of experience building modern, responsive web
          interfaces. Focused on clean UI, usability, and reliable frontend delivery
          with strong attention to detail.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Skills</h2>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="pill">React JS</span>
          <span class="pill">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="pill">HTML5</span>
          <span class="pill">CSS3</span>
          <span class="pill">Bootstrap</span>
          <span class="pill">Tailwind CSS</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Tools / Environment</h2>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="pill">VS Code</span>
          <span class="pill">Git</span>
          <span class="pill">Postman</span>
          <span class="pill">Figma</span>
          <span class="pill">Chrome DevTools</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <div class="entry">
          <div>
            <strong>React Developer</strong> — Nissi Software System
          </div>
          <div class="muted">1 year</div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Built responsive web interfaces with React and Tailwind.</li>
          <li>Collaborated with UI teams to deliver clean, modern layouts.</li>
          <li>Focused on performance, accessibility, and cross-browser consistency.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <p><strong>Gutor</strong> — Incident and audit workflows with a focus on clarity, speed, and data visibility.</p>
        <p><strong>Digi Auth</strong> — Authentication flows with responsive UI and user-friendly validation.</p>
        <p><strong>ORB</strong> — Interactive dashboards and components built for quick decision-making.</p>
        <p><strong>IME</strong> — Form-heavy workflows with accessibility and performance in mind.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <p><strong>MCA</strong> — AVC College of Engineering</p>
        <p><strong>BCA</strong> — AVC College (Autonomous)</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Certifications</h2>
        <p><strong>Java Full Stack</strong> — Greens Technology, Chennai</p>
        <p><strong>C, C++</strong> — CSC, Mayiladuthurai</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Languages</h2>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="pill">Tamil</span>
          <span class="pill">English</span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
